Flexible Software Package (FSP)
###############################

Origin:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation
   https://www.renesas.com/us/en/software-tool/flexible-software-package-fsp

Status:
   version v1.0.0

Purpose:
   Flexible Software Package (FSP) for Renesas RH850 MCU Family.

Description:
   This package is a snapshot from the RH850 FSP software released by Renesas Electronics Corporation
   It contain the HAL and a set of device headers files for the Renesas RH850 MCUs

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   N/A

Commit:
   N/A

Maintained-by:
   Renesas Electronics Corporation

License:
   BSD-3-Clause

License Link:
   https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause

Patch List:

   * Add experimental GCC compiler support in BSP compiler support layer
     Use section names without quotes for BSP_PRAGMA_SECTION_* macros, place symbols in section
     with `ghs section` pragma and add BSP_SECTION_FENMI_TEXT, BSP_SECTION_FEINT_TEXT section names
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rh850/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_compiler_support.h

   * Add GCC-specific software delay loop using unique asm labels (%=) and split it from
     the GHS/IAR variant
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rh850/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_delay.c

   * Add bound-check for g_pegcap_m_baseaddress before indexing it when moving to the next
     PEGCAP_M module
   Impacted files:
      drivers/rh850/fsp/src/bsp/mcu/all/bsp_guard.c

   * Add experimental GCC backend for the RH850 core access layer and define the interrupt
     attribute macros as empty for GCC
   Impacted files:
      zephyr/rh850/portable/bsp_exceptions.h
      zephyr/rh850/rh850-core/G4-profile/rh850_gcc_g4.h
      zephyr/rh850/rh850-core/rh850_compiler.h
      zephyr/rh850/rh850-core/rh850_gcc.h
